                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Preston, Secretary of the Navy, to Captain Newton,
                        United States Navy.</hi>
                </head>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Navy Department</hi></placeName>,
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1850-05-16"><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >May</hi> 16, 1850</date>.</dateline>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>Captain <hi rendition="#small-caps">John T. Newton</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Commanding Navy-Yard, Pensacola, Florida:</hi></p>
                <p>The Germ an town and Vixen are to be prepared for immediate service
                    Sailing-instructions will be sent by mail.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM BALLARD PRESTON.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
